WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.020
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.290 --> 00:29.250
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.480 --> 00:32.950
[Episode 20]

4
00:33.560 --> 00:34.470
Qiu.

5
00:37.070 --> 00:38.430
We're all safe now.

6
00:38.840 --> 00:39.370
Let's go.

7
00:39.470 --> 00:40.270
Let's go home.

8
00:50.170 --> 00:52.680
I want you to feel

9
00:52.750 --> 00:55.840
the pain of losing your loved ones.

10
01:36.490 --> 01:37.330
I'm fine.

11
01:37.620 --> 01:38.950
I'll be okay in a minute.

12
01:39.350 --> 01:40.550
Just give me a minute.

13
01:41.750 --> 01:42.390
Qiu,

14
01:44.400 --> 01:46.000
I thought this time

15
01:46.000 --> 01:48.229
I could finally protect you.

16
01:48.870 --> 01:49.479
No.

17
01:49.479 --> 01:50.560
Don't say that.

18
01:51.350 --> 01:52.560
I'm sorry.

19
01:52.560 --> 01:53.120
Don't.

20
01:53.120 --> 01:54.310
I failed again.

21
02:00.040 --> 02:00.760
Qiu,

22
02:02.230 --> 02:03.560
do you still remember

23
02:04.640 --> 02:06.680
how to break immortality?

24
02:09.970 --> 02:12.130
If I die,

25
02:13.310 --> 02:16.820
does that mean we truly love each other?

26
02:20.220 --> 02:21.100
No.

27
02:25.280 --> 02:26.520
No.

28
02:26.520 --> 02:29.030
I don't want this!

29
02:29.030 --> 02:30.870
You can't die!

30
02:31.840 --> 02:32.280
I...

31
02:32.630 --> 02:33.430
No!

32
02:34.120 --> 02:35.470
I don't love you!

33
02:36.120 --> 02:40.310
I don't love you!

34
02:41.360 --> 02:43.250
I don't love you!

35
02:43.360 --> 02:44.120
Qiu...

36
02:47.030 --> 02:48.079
I want a hug.

37
02:49.520 --> 02:50.730
Let me hug you.

38
03:12.410 --> 03:13.220
Qiu...

39
03:22.310 --> 03:23.120
Qiu.

40
03:24.310 --> 03:25.150
You're...

41
03:25.980 --> 03:27.210
free now.

42
03:56.590 --> 03:58.470
No!

43
03:58.470 --> 04:00.800
I don't love you.

44
04:01.400 --> 04:02.680
I don't love you.

45
04:02.680 --> 04:06.470
Ning Changyue, I don't love you.

46
04:07.590 --> 04:10.840
I don't love you, Ning Changyue!

47
04:10.840 --> 04:13.080
I don't love you!

48
04:18.750 --> 04:20.720
No!

49
04:24.120 --> 04:27.000
I don't love you!

50
04:43.060 --> 04:44.690
Ning Changyue!

51
04:46.800 --> 04:48.190
Ning Changyue!

52
04:56.600 --> 04:57.600
Ning Changyue!

53
04:59.240 --> 05:00.430
Ning Changyue!

54
05:02.020 --> 05:07.250
♪ Why do you insist on finding me? ♪

55
05:03.430 --> 05:04.240
Coming.

56
05:05.800 --> 05:07.200
Why did you drink so much?

57
05:07.360 --> 05:08.160
Does your head hurt?

58
05:08.160 --> 05:08.600
Here.

59
05:08.720 --> 05:09.240
Let me massage it.

60
05:08.870 --> 05:14.390
♪ You know I didn't want to stay ♪

61
05:11.510 --> 05:12.040
How is it?

62
05:12.360 --> 05:13.000
Better?

63
05:15.600 --> 05:16.750
That's what you get for drinking so much.

64
05:16.750 --> 05:23.380
♪ You hold me tight ♪

65
05:16.950 --> 05:17.750
Regret it now?

66
05:23.690 --> 05:29.130
♪ But I am fading away ♪

67
05:38.040 --> 05:38.950
Let's go.

68
05:40.120 --> 05:41.630
I don't want to go.

69
05:41.630 --> 05:42.630
Why are you so lazy?

70
05:42.630 --> 05:43.890
You little lazybones.

71
05:43.920 --> 05:45.040
I don't want to go.

72
05:45.040 --> 05:45.830
Alright, alright.

73
05:45.730 --> 05:52.630
♪ You hold me tight ♪

74
05:45.920 --> 05:46.920
Once we're done,

75
05:46.920 --> 05:48.920
I'll take you out for some nice food.

76
05:49.830 --> 05:50.490
Sound good?

77
05:53.300 --> 05:58.640
♪ I lose my way ♪

78
06:08.070 --> 06:09.270
You're back.

79
06:09.950 --> 06:11.010
I'm out of battery.

80
06:11.390 --> 06:12.120
I can't move.

81
06:12.510 --> 06:13.510
Need to recharge.

82
06:15.650 --> 06:17.090
Okay, okay.

83
06:18.070 --> 06:19.560
Alright.

84
06:19.950 --> 06:21.560
No, not fully charged yet.

85
06:21.730 --> 06:23.040
Charge a little longer.

86
06:23.040 --> 06:24.040
That's enough.

87
06:25.780 --> 06:26.480
Need more.

88
06:27.230 --> 06:33.230
♪ Will you still think of me? ♪

89
06:27.750 --> 06:29.830
I need more. Not full yet.

90
06:29.830 --> 06:31.070
Why is there a fish missing?

91
06:31.070 --> 06:32.020
I want a cuddle.

92
06:33.120 --> 06:34.190
Give me a cuddle.

93
06:34.130 --> 06:38.720
♪ Do you know I was afraid? ♪

94
06:34.480 --> 06:35.600
Forget the fish.

95
06:40.980 --> 06:42.860
Beg me, and I'll cook for you today.

96
06:41.260 --> 06:47.980
♪ When you used to hold me tight ♪

97
06:46.240 --> 06:48.570
Please, babe.

98
06:48.600 --> 06:49.310
Call me hubby.

99
06:48.860 --> 06:58.230
♪ I lost my way right then ♪

100
06:50.360 --> 06:51.500
Please, hubby.

101
06:51.520 --> 06:52.840
Give me a kiss.

102
06:52.870 --> 06:53.920
Oh, stop it.

103
06:54.720 --> 06:55.630
Fine...

104
06:56.240 --> 06:57.640
We're having beef today.

105
07:36.240 --> 07:37.270
We made a promise.

106
07:39.240 --> 07:40.840
We have to watch it together.

107
07:42.390 --> 07:44.159
Watch it bloom.

108
07:50.480 --> 07:51.720
Ning Changyue,

109
07:54.560 --> 07:56.360
you liar.

110
08:19.310 --> 08:20.260
Aunt Song,

111
08:21.040 --> 08:22.360
have you...

112
08:22.870 --> 08:24.310
not eaten for days?

113
08:27.430 --> 08:28.160
How about...

114
08:28.750 --> 08:29.920
we go out for a walk?

115
08:30.580 --> 08:33.890
[Three Months Later]

116
08:37.750 --> 08:38.440
Over here.

117
08:38.770 --> 08:39.559
A little more here.

118
08:39.559 --> 08:40.039
Okay.

119
08:40.059 --> 08:41.100
Nice and red.

120
08:44.000 --> 08:45.030
So pretty this way.

121
08:45.030 --> 08:45.670
Right?

122
08:46.120 --> 08:46.870
Perfect.

123
08:48.060 --> 08:49.120
Just stay here with us

124
08:49.120 --> 08:50.760
and enjoy the sunshine.

125
08:55.890 --> 08:56.720
Qiu.

126
09:16.440 --> 09:17.240
What are you looking at?

127
09:17.240 --> 09:18.040
What's wrong?

128
09:27.510 --> 09:29.110
I bet you didn't expect this.

129
09:29.200 --> 09:30.320
I saw everything.

130
09:33.750 --> 09:35.990
You finally go out today.

131
09:36.010 --> 09:37.150
And you're in a bad mood.

132
09:37.150 --> 09:39.360
Let's just forget about everything for a while.

133
09:39.360 --> 09:39.860
And...

134
09:40.440 --> 09:41.640
have a drink to relax.

135
09:41.840 --> 09:42.320
Okay?

136
09:43.030 --> 09:43.560
Sit down.

137
09:43.790 --> 09:44.450
Have a seat.

138
09:45.150 --> 09:45.750
Okay.

139
09:48.230 --> 09:49.510
Do you remember the last time

140
09:49.510 --> 09:50.510
you were here?

141
09:51.670 --> 09:52.390
Seriously,

142
09:52.530 --> 09:54.460
you were the craziest person I've ever seen.

143
09:54.460 --> 09:55.390
You were so cute.

144
09:57.320 --> 09:58.200
Hello.

145
09:58.440 --> 09:59.440
Hello, Ms. Song.

146
09:59.630 --> 10:01.840
This is Eternal Vows Wedding Planning.

147
10:01.980 --> 10:02.790
Mr. Ning Changyue

148
10:02.790 --> 10:03.360
booked a full wedding package

149
10:03.360 --> 10:04.330
with us

150
10:04.350 --> 10:05.900
three months ago.

151
10:06.270 --> 10:08.870
The venue and catering are all set.

152
10:08.870 --> 10:10.540
The wedding is scheduled for next week.

153
10:10.540 --> 10:11.900
We just wanted to confirm

154
10:11.900 --> 10:13.900
if there are any changes on your end.

155
10:15.750 --> 10:16.600
Ms. Song?

156
10:17.550 --> 10:18.550
No changes.

157
10:19.300 --> 10:19.850
Alright.

158
10:20.330 --> 10:21.570
I won't bother you any further.

159
10:21.570 --> 10:22.600
Have a great day.

160
10:29.630 --> 10:30.720
Idiot.

161
10:32.690 --> 10:34.980
You started preparing three months ago.

162
11:01.700 --> 11:02.270
Qiu,

163
11:02.820 --> 11:03.660
marry me.

164
11:36.710 --> 11:45.400
♪ Writing all over your walls ♪

165
11:40.630 --> 11:41.750
Ning Changyue,

166
11:43.000 --> 11:44.120
at first,

167
11:44.960 --> 11:47.240
I thought immortality was a reward.

168
11:45.980 --> 11:55.490
♪ I was here but now I must leave ♪

169
11:48.440 --> 11:50.360
Like the gods favored us,

170
11:51.460 --> 11:54.630
stretching out our time inch by inch,

171
11:55.600 --> 11:58.000
so we could have each other forever.

172
11:59.150 --> 12:00.870
But later I realized

173
12:01.770 --> 12:05.170
time never deepens love on its own.

174
12:06.670 --> 12:08.910
Sometimes it wears down the passion,

175
12:09.250 --> 12:10.770
and dilutes the thrill.

176
12:11.960 --> 12:15.000
It makes the earth-shattering romance

177
12:15.840 --> 12:19.000
slowly fade into the mundane routine of daily life.

178
12:20.550 --> 12:21.750
During that time,

179
12:21.030 --> 12:25.160
♪ I won't fall in a cage ♪

180
12:23.600 --> 12:26.270
I thought I had lost it.

181
12:25.180 --> 12:27.160
♪ Missing old days ♪

182
12:26.790 --> 12:27.870
I thought I forgot

183
12:27.270 --> 12:33.660
♪ I will be here, I will stay ♪

184
12:29.120 --> 12:29.910
what love

185
12:31.270 --> 12:32.670
truly is.

186
12:34.050 --> 12:37.160
♪ Let them judge as they please ♪

187
12:37.610 --> 12:39.730
♪ There will be brighter days ♪

188
12:39.970 --> 12:45.700
♪ I will stay ♪

189
12:47.840 --> 12:48.890
Ms. Song Yiqiu,

190
12:49.430 --> 12:50.470
before the vows,

191
12:51.380 --> 12:53.110
on behalf of Mr. Ning Changyue,

192
12:53.450 --> 12:54.910
I'd like to give you a gift.

193
12:58.720 --> 12:59.440
Hi!

194
12:59.460 --> 13:00.460
It's Wu Ya here.

195
13:00.490 --> 13:01.440
Welcome to my uncle's

196
13:01.440 --> 13:03.160
secret wedding prep vlog!

197
13:03.190 --> 13:03.880
Let's go!

198
13:05.840 --> 13:06.910
My uncle

199
13:06.910 --> 13:08.550
has been acting super sneaky lately.

200
13:08.550 --> 13:09.720
I have no idea what he's up to.

201
13:09.720 --> 13:11.450
Let's go check it out together.

202
13:12.910 --> 13:13.630
Uncle!

203
13:14.440 --> 13:17.200
Are you planning to propose?

204
13:18.830 --> 13:19.880
Are you?

205
13:19.960 --> 13:20.870
Are you?

206
13:20.160 --> 13:23.780
♪ Two mismatching souls ♪

207
13:20.870 --> 13:21.600
Are you?

208
13:21.600 --> 13:22.510
Tell me!

209
13:22.510 --> 13:23.510
Give me the phone.

210
13:23.920 --> 13:27.220
♪ We never saw it coming ♪

211
13:24.000 --> 13:25.890
No! I'm going

212
13:25.960 --> 13:26.840
to tell Aunt Song now!

213
13:26.840 --> 13:28.080
Hand over the phone!

214
13:27.400 --> 13:33.960
♪ Forever is shorter than we thought ♪

215
13:28.080 --> 13:28.600
If she finds out,

216
13:28.600 --> 13:29.440
-I'll kill you! -No!

217
13:29.440 --> 13:30.200
No way!

218
13:33.840 --> 13:34.340
Stay still.

219
13:34.340 --> 13:37.860
♪ The fading shadows of our love ♪

220
13:35.320 --> 13:36.150
What's this?

221
13:37.880 --> 13:41.350
♪ Echoing endlessly in the dark ♪

222
13:38.240 --> 13:39.320
Qiu's ring size.

223
13:39.320 --> 13:40.770
Come with me to buy the ring.

224
13:40.770 --> 13:42.550
You used this to measure Qiu's finger?

225
13:41.380 --> 13:48.150
♪ Don't cling to what should have been ♪

226
13:42.910 --> 13:44.440
She's going to be your aunt.

227
13:45.030 --> 13:47.600
Isn't this a bit sketchy?

228
13:47.840 --> 13:48.370
Sketchy?

229
13:48.780 --> 13:52.860
♪ We can't keep fighting for a ghost ♪

230
13:49.320 --> 13:50.510
Mind your own business.

231
13:50.510 --> 13:52.240
Where can I find a tape measure?

232
13:53.000 --> 13:55.780
♪ This empty house isn't a home ♪

233
13:53.440 --> 13:53.970
Hurry up.

234
13:54.030 --> 13:55.000
I can't hold this shape much longer.

235
13:55.000 --> 13:55.550
Let's go.

236
13:56.040 --> 14:01.540
♪ I think it's time to let us go ♪

237
13:56.670 --> 13:58.870
This is Aunt Song's ring finger, right?

238
14:02.090 --> 14:03.360
♪ Admit it ♪

239
14:03.730 --> 14:08.370
♪ What we already know ♪

240
14:04.120 --> 14:05.000
Give me a sec.

241
14:08.450 --> 14:09.570
First time getting married,

242
14:08.570 --> 14:13.520
♪ We can't keep fighting for the ghosts ♪

243
14:09.630 --> 14:10.830
he lacks experience.

244
14:12.030 --> 14:12.900
Song Yiqiu,

245
14:13.600 --> 14:14.320
will you...

246
14:14.510 --> 14:15.030
Stop.

247
14:15.390 --> 14:16.360
Your eyes are too stiff.

248
14:15.970 --> 14:19.800
♪ We can't keep fighting for the ghosts ♪

249
14:16.360 --> 14:17.420
You look like an AI.

250
14:18.200 --> 14:20.030
Come on, what do you want from me?

251
14:20.120 --> 14:23.150
♪ This empty house isn't a home ♪

252
14:20.360 --> 14:20.910
Uncle,

253
14:21.270 --> 14:22.210
you need to be sincere.

254
14:22.210 --> 14:23.140
Keep it natural.

255
14:23.440 --> 14:28.440
♪ I think it's time to let us go ♪

256
14:23.480 --> 14:25.630
Make her feel your heartbeat.

257
14:28.880 --> 14:30.270
♪ Admit it ♪

258
14:30.520 --> 14:36.610
♪ What we already know ♪

259
14:37.110 --> 14:40.690
♪ We can't keep fighting for the ghosts ♪

260
14:45.090 --> 14:45.670
Qiu,

261
14:51.450 --> 14:52.210
we

262
14:56.080 --> 14:57.630
spent 3000 years together,

263
15:00.080 --> 15:01.210
from being immortal

264
15:02.630 --> 15:04.490
to becoming ordinary people now.

265
15:07.790 --> 15:08.910
I want to ask

266
15:12.400 --> 15:14.510
can I be the one

267
15:17.080 --> 15:18.630
who stays by your side,

268
15:20.380 --> 15:22.180
and makes you happy every day?

269
15:28.480 --> 15:29.200
I love you.

270
15:34.600 --> 15:35.240
Uncle,

271
15:36.890 --> 15:38.050
I actually

272
15:38.120 --> 15:39.030
didn't record

273
15:39.670 --> 15:40.840
any of that.

274
15:42.510 --> 15:43.310
My phone died.

275
15:43.950 --> 15:45.190
I just wanted to see

276
15:45.240 --> 15:46.750
how long you'd practice.

277
15:49.000 --> 15:49.840
I'll love you forever!

278
15:49.840 --> 15:50.870
I'm going to...

279
15:51.200 --> 15:52.440
Can't catch me!

280
15:52.440 --> 15:53.790
Forgot to turn it off!

281
15:56.460 --> 15:57.820
But right now...

282
15:59.210 --> 16:00.780
I think I understand again.

283
16:01.550 --> 16:03.750
It's just the subconscious habit

284
16:04.360 --> 16:07.290
of wanting to call your name every time I turn around.

285
16:07.670 --> 16:10.030
It's the napkin you always have ready

286
16:10.440 --> 16:13.750
whenever I pop open a beer.

287
16:14.370 --> 16:16.500
It's the way, over thousands of years,

288
16:16.550 --> 16:18.270
you never hesitated

289
16:18.270 --> 16:20.200
to run toward me.

290
16:21.250 --> 16:23.010
Immortality may end,

291
16:24.070 --> 16:25.120
but love

292
16:25.840 --> 16:27.110
is eternal.

293
16:29.550 --> 16:30.670
Ms. Song Yiqiu,

294
16:32.240 --> 16:33.360
do you

295
16:34.270 --> 16:36.600
take Mr. Ning Changyue to be your husband?

296
16:37.790 --> 16:39.080
For better, for worse,

297
16:39.630 --> 16:40.960
for richer, for poorer,

298
16:41.270 --> 16:42.730
in sickness and in health,

299
16:43.610 --> 16:44.870
to love and to cherish?

300
18:14.720 --> 18:15.480
Qiu.

301
18:37.590 --> 18:38.310
Qiu.

302
19:00.850 --> 19:02.610
♪ Willing to give up immortality ♪

303
19:02.640 --> 19:04.440
♪ To share these joys and sorrows ♪

304
19:04.740 --> 19:07.140
♪ Who cares how absurd eternity may be ♪

305
19:07.510 --> 19:13.290
♪ I'd trade this life for eternity ♪

306
19:13.320 --> 19:16.980
♪ Then we'd be complete ♪
